      "Data Leak Protection (DLP) is an approach that ensures the prevention of any leakage of sensitive information. It involves implementing software solutions that enable network administrators to have control over the information and data that end-users are allowed to transfer from their systems. DLP software actively monitors and protects data at rest, in transit, and in use, ensuring that it remains secure throughout its lifecycle.",
