    title: "GRC Governance, Risk and Conpliance",
    excerpt: "In today's digital landscape, information security has become a top priority for organizations of all sizes. With the increase in cyber threats and the need to comply with regulations, businesses are establishing dedicated teams to ensure the effecti...",
